  "payout_probe": {
    "what": "A minimal throwaway contract (not part of this repo) with fund(), pay_accepted(to, amount) and pay_finalized(to, amount), each calling gl.chain.Account(to).emit_transfer(amount, on=...).",
    "contract": "0x1c6A8660D73cD0D593b8317433B79e1eFCEbe103",
    "funded_wei": "20000000000000000",
    "pay_accepted": "rejected by the chain in fee simulation: SystemError: 2: inval",
    "pay_finalized": {
      "tx": "0x2bba98073acde3b42073c5a548829cc7409e88b91dcbd5f19d118df20ffebf71",
      "status_after_38s": "FINALIZED",
      "recipient": "0x000000000000000000000000000000000000dEaD",
      "recipient_balance_delta_after_272s": "0",
      "contract_balance_after_272s": "20000000000000000"
    },
    "conclusion": "On this Studio Next deployment a contract's native-value emit_transfer is recorded but not delivered, independent of ShipOrSlash. Whether this is the simulator or a configuration is not established here."
  },
  "findings": [
    "Studio Next's transaction record has no resultName/statusName: status is a string, the consensus result is result_name / numeric result. The console's and the script's receipt checks read all three spellings and treat a name/number conflict as malformed.",
    "sim_fundAccount credits only the EIP-55 checksummed address.",
    "Writes and deploys need a full fee object (feeValue + distribution); a bare feeValue still reverts with FeeValueMustBeNonZero(1).",
    "withdraw_released's fee estimate includes ~0.12 GEN of message fees for the queued transfer.",
    "emit_transfer(on='accepted') is rejected by Studio Next; emit_transfer(on='finalized') is recorded on the finalized transaction but the value is not delivered (see payout_probe). Treat pull payments as UNVERIFIED on this network and verify on a network where native payouts are delivered before relying on them.",
    "A view reporting solvent=true is not evidence that a payout was delivered: it compares the contract's balance with its accounting, and an undelivered transfer leaves the balance high.",
    "A new vault is an offer. A claim from an unaccepted vault is refused by the chain: ERR_INVALID_STATE vault is PENDING_ACCEPTANCE.",
    "The deadline minimum is now 3 days (48-hour acceptance window plus one full day to ship); 259200 s is returned by get_constants as min_deadline_window.",
    "Studio Next simulates a write during fee estimation, so a write the contract would refuse fails at `estimate-fees` with 'execution failed'; the refusal text is in the base64 result of the failed simulation."
  ],
